    skos:scopeNote "A large tank or cask for storing or holding goods, whether liquid, such as chemicals or fermenting beer, or dry, often during a production process."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_com/concepts/139592> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Hursting Frame"@en ;
